%% Sequence: Reconciliacao de banca ao fim da sessao — V2 (corrige P1+P2+P3)
%% Spec: B:\grindfy\Docs\specs\session-end-reconciliation-v2.md
%% ADRs: 045 (tie-break proporcional), 046 (session_wallet_snapshots), 040 (v1 arquivada),
%%       017 (ledger imutavel), 033 (FX convention), 038 (optimistic concurrency).
%%
%% Cobre:
%%  - Happy path: PUT completed -> reset alarmes -> summary IN-PLACE -> dialog -> reconcile -> /grind.
%%  - Branch wallets.length === 0: pula dialog, redireciona apos summary skip.
%%  - Branch user clica "Iniciar Cool-down" (com sessionId, corrige P3).
%%  - Branch user clica "Pular reconciliacao" no dialog (skipReconciliation=true).
%%  - Branch alreadyReconciled (idempotencia): toast + redirect.
%%  - Branch 409 balance_mismatch: dialog mostra erro + opcao retry (refetch).
%%  - Branch GET /reconcilable-wallets falha 5xx: toast + redirect (nao bloqueia).
%%  - Branch PUT /grind-sessions falha: nao reseta alarmes, nao abre summary, toast.
%%  - Correcao P2: setLocation('/grind') NAO acontece em onSuccess de endSessionMutation.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Jogador
    participant UI as GrindSessionLive (client)
    participant Mut as endSessionMutation
    participant AlertMgr as sessionAlertManager
    participant Summary as SessionSummaryModal
    participant Flow as runSessionEndFlow
    participant Dlg as WalletReconciliationDialog
    participant API as Express server (server/routes/grind-sessions.ts)
    participant Svc as walletService.recordTransaction
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over User,UI: Sessao ativa em /grind-session-live. ConfirmationModal ja confirmou.

    User->>UI: Clica "Finalizar" (apos auto-finish de pendentes)
    UI->>Mut: endSessionMutation.mutate({ status: 'completed' })
    Mut->>API: PUT /api/grind-sessions/:id { status: 'completed' }
    API->>API: requireAuth + assertSessionOwnership
    API->>DB: UPDATE grind_sessions SET status='completed', endedAt=NOW()<br/>WHERE id=:id AND userId=:uid
    DB-->>API: ok
    API-->>Mut: 200 { session }

    alt Branch — PUT falhou (4xx/5xx)
        API-->>Mut: error
        Mut->>UI: onError -> toast "Falha ao encerrar sessao"
        Note over UI: Reset alarmes NAO acontece. Summary NAO abre.<br/>Sessao continua status='active'. User pode tentar de novo.
    end

    Note over Mut,UI: RF-01 — onSuccess: reset alarmes + summary IN-PLACE (corrige P2)
    Mut->>AlertMgr: sessionAlertManager.reset()
    Mut->>UI: setGenericAlerts([]) + setFiredGenericAlerts([])<br/>+ setActiveAlertCount(0)
    Mut->>UI: invalidate queries [grind-sessions, session-tournaments]
    Mut->>UI: setSessionSummaryData({ ...stats, sessionId: activeSession.id })
    Mut->>UI: setShowSessionSummary(true)
    Note over UI: NAO chama setLocation('/grind') aqui. Bug P2 evitado.

    UI->>Summary: render in-place com summaryData incluindo sessionId
    Summary->>User: Mostra 3 CTAs:<br/>"Cool-down completo" / "Quick cool-down" / "Finalizar Sessao"

    alt Branch — User clica "Iniciar Cool-down" (full ou quick) — corrige P3
        User->>Summary: Clica "Cool-down completo" ou "Quick cool-down"
        Summary->>Summary: handleStartCooldown(mode)
        Summary->>API: POST /api/cooldown-logs<br/>{ sessionId: summaryData.sessionId, mode }
        API->>API: requireAuth + insertCooldownLogSchema.parse()
        API->>DB: INSERT INTO cooldown_logs (id, userId, sessionId, mode, startedAt)
        DB-->>API: ok
        API-->>Summary: 201 { cooldownLog }
        Summary->>UI: telemetria cooldown_started_from_summary { sessionId, mode }
        Summary->>UI: setLocation('/cooldown/:id') ou abre cooldown UI in-place
        Note over Summary: P3 corrigido — sessionId presente, server nao retorna 400 "Required".
    end

    alt Branch — POST /api/cooldown-logs falha (RF-12)
        API-->>Summary: 400 / 401 / 409 / 500
        Summary->>Summary: errorMap por status (RF-12)
        Summary->>User: Toast PT-BR ("Sessao invalida...", "Cool-down ja iniciado...", etc)
        Summary->>UI: telemetria cooldown_create_failed { sessionId, httpStatus, errorMessage }
        Note over Summary: Modal continua aberto. User pode tentar outro CTA ou skip cool-down.
    end

    Note over User,Summary: Caminho principal: skip cool-down -> reconciliar
    User->>Summary: Clica "Finalizar Sessao" (skip cool-down)
    Summary->>UI: telemetria summary_finalize_clicked { sessionId }
    Summary->>UI: handleEndSession(sessionId)
    UI->>Flow: runSessionEndFlow(sessionId)
    Flow->>API: GET /api/grind-sessions/:id/reconcilable-wallets?includeAll=false

    Note over API,DB: RF-04 — pre-calculo expectedDelta server-side<br/>(ver sequence-expected-delta-calculation.mermaid)
    API->>API: requireAuth + assertSessionOwnership
    API->>DB: SELECT 1 FROM wallet_transactions<br/>WHERE session_id=:id AND reason='session_result'<br/>AND source='auto_session' LIMIT 1
    DB-->>API: rows (preflight idempotencia)

    alt Branch — alreadyReconciled (idempotencia preflight)
        API-->>Flow: 200 { sessionId, alreadyReconciled: true,<br/>wallets: [], orphanContribution: {} }
        Flow->>UI: toast "Esta sessao ja foi reconciliada"
        Flow->>UI: telemetria reconcile_failed { errorCode: 'already_reconciled' }
        Flow->>UI: setLocation('/grind')
    end

    Note over API,DB: Fluxo normal: deriva wallets via session_tournaments
    API->>DB: storage.listSessionTournaments(sessionId, status='finished')
    DB-->>API: tournaments[]
    API->>DB: storage.listWalletsByUser(userId, includeArchived=false)
    DB-->>API: wallets[] (active only)
    API->>DB: SELECT exchangeRates FROM user_settings WHERE userId=:uid
    DB-->>API: { exchangeRates }
    API->>API: calculateExpectedDeltaPerWallet(<br/>tournaments, wallets, exchangeRates)<br/>(detalhe em sequence-expected-delta-calculation.mermaid)
    API-->>Flow: 200 { sessionId, alreadyReconciled: false,<br/>wallets: [{ walletId, name, platform, nativeCurrency,<br/>openingBalance, expectedPreviousBalance, expectedDelta,<br/>expectedClosingBalance, contributingTournaments,<br/>hadActivityInSession }],<br/>orphanContribution: { USD: 0, BRL: 12.50 } }

    alt Branch — GET /reconcilable-wallets falha (5xx ou network)
        API-->>Flow: error
        Flow->>UI: toast "Nao foi possivel carregar carteiras"
        Flow->>UI: setLocation('/grind')
        Note over Flow: Spec NFR: falha do GET NAO bloqueia o flow.
    end

    alt Branch — wallets.length === 0 (sem session_tournaments finalizados)
        Note over Flow: Sem nada para reconciliar.
        Flow->>UI: telemetria reconcile_skipped_no_wallets { sessionId }
        Flow->>UI: setLocation('/grind')
    end

    Note over Flow,Dlg: RF-05 — wallets.length > 0 -> abre dialog
    Flow->>Dlg: openReconcileDialog(wallets, orphanContribution)
    Dlg->>Dlg: telemetria reconcile_dialog_opened<br/>{ sessionId, walletsCount, hadActivityCount,<br/>orphanCurrencies: ['BRL'] }
    Dlg->>User: Renderiza linhas com:<br/>- openingBalance (saldo inicial)<br/>- expectedDelta (delta esperado, verde/vermelho/cinza)<br/>- expectedClosingBalance (pre-preenche reportedBalance)<br/>- input "Saldo final reportado" editavel<br/>- preview manualAdjustment em tempo real<br/>- banner orphanContribution se > 0

    alt Branch — User edita reportedBalance
        User->>Dlg: Edita reportedBalance numa wallet
        Dlg->>Dlg: manualAdjustment = reportedBalance - expectedClosingBalance<br/>label "+R$X (extra)" verde / "-R$Y (saida)" vermelho / "Sem ajuste" cinza
    end

    alt Branch — User clica "Pular reconciliacao" (link terciario)
        User->>Dlg: Clica "Pular reconciliacao"
        Dlg->>Dlg: telemetria reconcile_skipped_user { sessionId, walletsCount }
        Dlg-->>UI: onClose (sem chamar POST /reconcile-wallets)
        UI->>UI: setLocation('/grind')
        Note over Dlg: Diferente da v1: NAO grava snapshot e NAO grava tx.
    end

    alt Branch — User clica "Sem ajuste manual"
        User->>Dlg: Clica "Sem ajuste manual"
        Dlg->>Dlg: payload com reportedBalance = expectedClosingBalance<br/>(manualAdjustment = 0 implicito)
        Note over Dlg: Continua para POST normal — grava snapshot com manualAdjustment=0.
    end

    Note over User,Dlg: Caminho principal: User confirma e gera ajustes
    User->>Dlg: Clica "Confirmar e gerar ajustes"
    Dlg->>API: POST /api/grind-sessions/:id/reconcile-wallets<br/>{ adjustments: [{ walletId, reportedBalance,<br/>expectedPreviousBalance, expectedDelta }],<br/>skipReconciliation: false }

    API->>API: requireAuth + walletLimiter + assertSessionOwnership
    API->>DB: SELECT 1 FROM wallet_transactions<br/>WHERE session_id=:id AND source='auto_session' LIMIT 1
    DB-->>API: rows

    alt Branch — 409 already_reconciled (race entre 2 abas)
        API-->>Dlg: 409 { errorCode: 'already_reconciled' }
        Dlg->>UI: telemetria reconcile_failed { errorCode, httpStatus: 409 }
        Dlg->>User: Toast "Sessao ja reconciliada anteriormente"
        Dlg-->>UI: onClose
        UI->>UI: setLocation('/grind')
    end

    Note over API,DB: RF-06 — loop fail-fast por wallet
    loop Para cada adjustment
        API->>API: delta_total = reportedBalance - expectedPreviousBalance<br/>manualAdjustment = delta_total - expectedDelta
        alt |delta_total| < 0.01
            Note over API: Pula tx mas grava snapshot.
        else delta_total >= 0.01
            API->>Svc: walletService.recordTransaction(<br/>walletId, direction, |delta_total|,<br/>reason='session_result', source='auto_session',<br/>sessionId, expectedPreviousBalance)
            Svc->>DB: BEGIN; SELECT balance FROM wallets<br/>WHERE id=:wid FOR UPDATE
            DB-->>Svc: { balance: actualPrevious }
            alt actualPrevious !== expectedPreviousBalance (ADR-038)
                Svc->>DB: ROLLBACK
                Svc-->>API: throw 409 balance_mismatch
                API-->>Dlg: 409 { errorCode: 'balance_mismatch',<br/>failedAt: { walletId, error } }
                Dlg->>UI: telemetria reconcile_failed { errorCode, httpStatus: 409 }
                Dlg->>Dlg: refetch GET /reconcilable-wallets (novo opening)<br/>+ recompute manualAdjustment preservando reportedBalance
                Dlg->>User: Toast "Saldo da wallet mudou. Confira e reenvie."
                Note over Dlg: Wallets ja persistidas anteriores no loop ficam disabled.
            end
            Svc->>DB: INSERT wallet_transactions (...)<br/>UPDATE wallets SET balance=newBalance<br/>COMMIT
            DB-->>Svc: tx
            Svc-->>API: { tx }
        end
        API->>DB: INSERT session_wallet_snapshots<br/>(sessionId, walletId, openingBalance, closingBalance,<br/>expectedDelta, manualAdjustment, contributingTournamentIds,<br/>walletTransactionId, reason='session_result')
        DB-->>API: snapshot
    end

    API-->>Dlg: 200 { snapshotsCreated, txCreated[], skipped }
    Dlg->>UI: telemetria reconcile_submitted<br/>{ sessionId, snapshotsCreated, txCreated.length, skipped }
    Dlg->>UI: handleReconcileComplete()
    UI->>UI: invalidate queries [wallets, bankroll-snapshots]
    UI->>UI: setLocation('/grind')

    Note over UI,User: Pos-merge: SessionHistory edit modal exibe aba "Banca"<br/>via GET /api/grind-sessions/:id/wallet-snapshots (RF-09).
